e-height:1.4\">农民因蝗灾防治成本不断增加而沮丧</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Farmers frustrated as locust control costs add up</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">面对日益严重的蝗灾，全球多地农民因持续上升的蝗虫防治成本而倍感压力和沮丧。高昂的农药费用和劳动力支出严重侵蚀了他们的利润，威胁到农业生产和粮食安全，引发对蝗灾应对策略的关注。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/white-house-press-secretary-katie-zacharia-let-go-just-days-into-role/article71594137.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">白宫新闻秘书凯蒂·扎卡里亚上任数日后被“解雇”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">White House Press Secretary Katie Zacharia ‘let go’ just days into role</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">白宫新闻秘书凯蒂·扎卡里亚在就职仅数日后便被“解雇”，这一突发人事变动引发了外界对白宫内部运作和沟通团队稳定性的广泛猜测。此事件凸显了政府高级职位的人事任命和管理挑战。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/sport/361042748/family-and-world-cup-dream-drive-matildas-star-tameka-yallop-wellington-phoenix\" target=\"_bl