tom:3px;line-height:1.4\">南非：患者从疑似非法康复中心被解救，曾遭锁链禁锢</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Patients in chains rescued from suspected illegal rehab centre in South Africa</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">南非警方成功解救了一群被锁链禁锢的患者，他们被困在一个疑似非法的康复中心。这起事件揭露了该国医疗机构监管的漏洞以及对弱势群体权利的侵犯，引起社会对非法拘禁和虐待的广泛关注。（社会新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c65ynk7212vqo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">西岸地区：巴勒斯坦人和美国记者遭以色列定居者袭击受伤</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Palestinians and US journalist injured by Israeli settlers in West Bank harvest attack</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在约旦河西岸的收获季节，巴勒斯坦人和一名美国记者遭到以色列定居者的袭击并受伤。此次事件凸显了该地区持续的紧张局势和暴力冲突，以及以色列定居者对巴勒斯坦社区的潜在威胁，引发国际社会对巴以冲突升级的担忧。（冲突报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmwy43pp08elo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">巴西国会批准缩短工作周，系卢拉政府一项胜利</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Brazil&#x27;s Congress approves shorter working week in win for Lula</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">巴西国会通过一项法案，允许企业在不降低工资的前提下，将工作时间从每周44小时缩短至36小时，这被视为卢拉总统在劳工政策上取得的重要进展，旨在改善就业环境和工人福祉。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
